<title>USA: Butler Manufacturing seeks NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Butler Manufacturing seeks NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Butler Manufacturing Co said Friday it applied for listing on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It expects its securities to begin trading on the Big Board under the symbol &quot;BBR&quot; by early November.</p>
<p>Butler supplies building systems, specialty components and construction services for the nonresidential construction market.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
